OL,3,GNEWSAMystery of man found dead in
OL,4,Awetsuit deepens as inquest questions
OL,5,Aethnicity
OL,6,
OL,7,FAn unidentified man whose body was
OL,8,Fdiscovered in a reservoir in mid Wales
OL,9,Ftwo years ago may not have been of
OL,10,Fwhite ethnicity as previously thought,
OL,11,Fan inquest heard.
OL,13,FThe body of the man, who was wearing an
OL,14,Fopen water swimming wetsuit, was found
OL,15,Fby a dogwalker at the Claerwen
OL,16,FReservoir near Rhayader, Powys, in
OL,17,FOctober 2024.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,438,430,260,140,0,100
